r movement and voice feedback is constructed to achieve automatic assessment and personalized guidance on the accuracy and completion of rehabilitation movements;\n(3) Constructed a standardized Baduanjin animation asset library tailored for rehabilitation scenarios, which facilitates the normative representation of intangible cultural heritage and supports the integra-\ntion of motion recognition   users’ self-perception of movement accu-\nracy and execution initiative through virtualized body synchronized feedback and virtual NPC guidance mechanism. The improvement of embodied cognition and operation fluency suggests that immersive somatosensory interaction can effectively stimulate users’ willingness to participate in movements, thus overcoming the training burnout caused by content repetition in traditional rehabilitation. This effect may be attributed to the scoring feedback mechanism based on skeletal matching in the system, as well as the extrinsic motivational support from the point and unlock incentive model.\nSecond, TWJB demonstrated favorable user feedback in terms of im-\nmersive experience. The system enhances the sense of context through cultural avatar characterization, ancient style training scene creation and traditional music soundtrack, providing a complete multimodal Computers & Graphics 132 (2025) 104378 8\x0cY. Zhang et al.\nimmersive environment  \n\nStatement: TWJB system (gamified virtual rehabilitation system) evaluate Self-perception of movement accuracy\n\nTask:\nYou are a data auditor and need to determine if this statement is correct. Evaluate this statement strictly based on the provided background information. Do not use external knowledge.\n\nInstructions:\n- Output only a single digit: 5 or 1, 5 for True, 1 for False.\n- Do not include any explanation, punctuation, or extra text.\n\nYour output:'}], 'model': 'deepseek-reasoner', 'stream': False}}
